{
  "folder": "RH2MA271O9rDo87z",
  "name": "海精靈(EGW)Sea Elf",
  "type": "race",
  "_id": "vt659FayHjRiqWyo",
  "img": "icons/environment/wilderness/cave-entrance-island.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><h2 style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\">精靈<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:22pt;COLOR:maroon\">Elf</span></h2><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">   </em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">“我從來沒想到會有這麼美麗的地方，”金月輕聲說。一整天的跋涉非常辛苦，但最後的報償卻遠遠超乎他們的想像。大夥站在一個懸崖上遠眺着傳說中的城市奎靈諾斯。</em></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><br /></em></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">    </em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">四隻細長的尖塔從城市的四個角落高聳入雲，白色的大理石建築閃耀着眩目的銀光。優雅的拱橋從一個尖塔跳躍到另一個尖塔，在空中畫出美麗的弧形。這些拱橋出自古老矮人工匠的手藝，可以支撐一整批部隊，外表看起來卻似乎連小鳥都能夠破壞它優美的平衡。這些閃耀着的拱形是城市的唯一界限。奎靈諾斯四周沒有城牆。這座精靈城市愛憐地對荒野伸出友誼之手。</em></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:right;MARGIN:2pt 0cm;text-align:right\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">——</em></span>Margaret Weis<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">與</span>Tracy Hickman<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">，</em></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><br /></em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">《秋暮之巨龍</em></span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">Dragons of Autumn Twilight</em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">》</em></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><br /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /></em></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">精靈是一個帶着超凡脫俗般優雅的魔幻民族。他們生活於現世，卻又不完全屬於這裏。他們居住在擁有非凡美麗的地方：那些遠古森林的中心或是那閃耀着仙靈之光的銀色尖塔下。在他們的家園，輕悠的音樂在空氣中流淌，幽雅的芬芳從溪流中飄蕩。精靈們熱愛自然和魔法，熱愛藝術和技藝，熱愛詩歌和音樂，熱愛這世上一切的美好之物。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /></span></p><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm\"><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-element:para-border-div\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:medium none;PAGE-BREAK-AFTER:avoid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;MARGIN:2pt 0cm;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-pagination:lines-together;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #B79C61 1.0pt;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm;mso-out1ine-1evel:3\"><strong>纖瘦而優雅Slender and Graceful</strong></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">精靈因其超凡脫俗的優雅和精緻的面容被人類和許多其他種族視爲奪心攝魄的美人。其平均身高比人類稍矮，範圍約在</span>5<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">尺到</span>6<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">尺之間。他們比人類纖瘦，體重只有</span>100<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">磅到</span>145<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">磅之間。精靈男女身高差異不大，男性也僅僅是略重於女性。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break;mso-column-break-before:always\" /></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">精靈的膚色包括了人類常見的種種膚色，此外還有青銅色、紅銅色甚至還有青白瓷色。他們長着綠色或藍色的頭髮，以及有如池水般剔透的金色或銀色眼睛。精靈不長鬍子，體毛也稀少。他們喜歡款式高雅、顏色明亮的衣服，也喜歡式樣簡潔可愛的珠寶。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /></span></p><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm\"><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-element:para-border-div\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:medium none;PAGE-BREAK-AFTER:avoid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;MARGIN:2pt 0cm;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-pagination:lines-together;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #B79C61 1.0pt;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm;mso-out1ine-1evel:3\"><strong>永恆視角A Timeless Perspective</strong></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">精靈的壽命可以超過</span>700<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">年，因此他們會以超然的視角看待很多事，而類似事件卻會深深困擾那些短命的種族。他們時常會覺得愉快卻不常感覺興奮，容易感覺好奇卻不易引起貪念。即使遇到極偶然的事件，他們也傾向於保持冷淡和從容。不過，當精靈致力於某個目標——比如試圖完成一場冒險，學習一項新技術或者新技藝時，他們也會變得專注而嚴苛。精靈交友和樹敵都很慢，而要忘卻朋友或敵人則會更慢。他們對些微的冒犯報以鄙夷，對嚴重的侮辱則報以無情的復仇。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /></span></p><p><br style=\"mso-column-break-before:always\" /></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">精靈面對危險時如稚嫩樹枝般柔韌靈活。與其訴諸暴力，精靈更傾向於以外交和妥協的手段解決糾紛。其領土的入侵史中曾有精靈們撤回森林深處，而等待入侵者自行離開的案例。不過一旦他們奮起抗爭，精靈將揭示其嚴格軍事化的一面，並向世界展示其精湛的劍術、弓術以及戰術謀略。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /></span></p><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm\"><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-element:para-border-div\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:medium none;PAGE-BREAK-AFTER:avoid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;MARGIN:2pt 0cm;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-pagination:lines-together;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #B79C61 1.0pt;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm;mso-out1ine-1evel:3\"><strong>林中祕境Hidden Woodland Realms</strong></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">精靈大多隱居在森林裏的小村莊中。他們狩獵野獸，採集食物，種植蔬菜，其只需依靠技藝和魔法就能自給自足而不用辛苦的開墾勞作。精靈們都是天生的藝術家，能製作出精美的衣物和藝術品。精靈與外界的交流相當有限，但確實有一些精靈會以精靈製品與外界交易金屬（精靈對礦工工作完全沒興致），並因此過上不錯的日子。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">在精靈領地外遇到的精靈一般都是遊唱藝人，藝術家或智者。人類貴族們常常會爲了爭奪一個精靈家庭教師來教導孩子劍術和魔法而引起彼此間的競爭。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /></span></p><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm\"><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-element:para-border-div\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:medium none;PAGE-BREAK-AFTER:avoid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;MARGIN:2pt 0cm;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-pagination:lines-together;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #B79C61 1.0pt;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm;mso-out1ine-1evel:3\"><strong>探索與冒險Exploration and Adventure</strong></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">精靈常因旅行慾望的驅使而踏上冒險之路。由於壽命悠長，他們往往可以享受長達幾個世紀的冒險生涯。精靈們並不喜歡日新月異的人類社會生活節奏。所以精靈常常尋找可以隨意旅行，又可以按自己的節奏生活的工作。精靈也同樣很享受練習武藝或者精研魔法的過程，而冒險生活又恰好滿足這點。一些精靈可能會加入反抗強權的勢力併爲其戰鬥，或者成爲所謂的衛道士，爲了道德而奮鬥。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /></span></p><p><br style=\"mso-column-break-before:always\" /></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><strong>精靈姓名Elf Names</strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">精靈通常會在百歲生日後宣佈自己成年，然後爲自己選擇一個名字。在此之前這名精靈都會被看作是個孩子，並用其小名作稱謂。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">宣佈自己成年後，精靈將爲自己選擇一個正式的名字。但就算是知道他已成年的人，仍可能繼續用先前的幼名稱呼他，而他本人也不見得介意。成年精靈的名字完全自創，雖然可能反映他喜歡的某些人名，或家人的名字。精靈男女名字的差異不大，而下述分組只是表示一般的傾向。此外，精靈也有家族姓氏，通常是由一些普通精靈詞彙組合而成。有些精靈在旅行時會將姓氏譯爲通用語，有些則仍保留精靈語的用法。</span></p><p class=\"MsoList\" style=\"MARGIN:0cm 0cm 6pt 11.05pt;TEXT-INDENT:-11.05pt;mso-add-space:auto;mso-char-indent-count:-1.0\"><strong>小名Child Names：</strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">阿拉</span>Ara<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、布林</span>Bryn<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、戴爾</span>Del<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、埃琳</span>Eryn<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、費恩</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Faen</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、伊尼爾</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Innil</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、萊爾</span>Lael<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、梅拉</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Mella</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、奈爾</span>Naill<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、娜爾思</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Naeris</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、費安</span>Phann<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、雷爾</span>Rael<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、裏恩</span>Rinn<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、薩伊</span>Sai<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、塞琳</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Syllin</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、泰雅</span>Thia<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、瓦爾</span>Vall</p><p class=\"MsoList\" style=\"MARGIN:6pt 0cm 0cm 11.05pt;TEXT-INDENT:-11.05pt;mso-add-space:auto;mso-char-indent-count:-1.0\"><strong>成年男性名字Male Adult Names：</strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">阿德蘭</span>Adran<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、埃勒</span>Aelar<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、阿拉密爾</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Aramil</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、阿蘭尼斯</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Arannis</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、歐斯特</span>Aust<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、貝羅</span>Beiro<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、貝里安</span>Berrian<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、卡里克</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Carric</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、埃裏溫</span>Erevan<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、恩尼亞里斯</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Enialis</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、厄丹</span>Erdan<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、利阿丹</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Riardon</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、戈林登</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Galinndan</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、哈達拉伊</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Hadarai</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、海安</span>Heian<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、西摩</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Himo</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、伊米羅</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Immeral</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、伊維里歐斯</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Ivellios</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、勞西安</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Laucian</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、明達提斯</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Mindartis</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、佩倫</span>Peren<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、皮裏阿斯</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Paelias</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、奎里昂</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Quarion</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、羅倫</span>Rolen<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、索維里斯</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Soveliss</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、薩米爾</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Thamior</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、薩里伏</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Tharivol</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、瓦瑞斯</span>Varis</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"> </p><h4 style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\">高傲卻和善Haughty but Gracious</h4><p class=\"1\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:justify;TEXT-JUSTIFY:inter-ideograph;MARGIN:0cm 0.55pt 0cm 0cm;LINE-HEIGHT:13pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span>精靈一般對人和善，同時又常常會表現出傲慢姿態。不過就算是面對那些大失其期望的情況（大多來自非精靈族），他們也不會忘記表現的親切有禮。幸運的是他們總能從別人身上找到優點。<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt;mso-fareast-font-family:'STHeiti light'\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">矮人Dwarves</strong></em>。“矮人都是沉悶的呆瓜莽漢。不過他們渾身都是勇氣，也就只是缺點幽默感，不夠世故又不懂禮貌而已。而且必須承認，他們最好的鐵匠生產的藝術品已經幾乎能達到精靈的質量標準了。”<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt;mso-fareast-font-family:'STHeiti light'\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">半身人Halflings</strong></em>。“半身人是單純快樂的民族，而這種品性不該被鄙視。他們都是好人，而且又會互相照顧還會搞園藝，而且他們還能在必要時證明自己比看起頑強得多。”<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt;mso-fareast-font-family:'STHeiti light'\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">人類Humans。</strong></em>“人類總是匆匆忙忙。他們野心勃勃又總想在其短暫的人生完成某些事情。人類的那些事業看起來那麼的蒼白無力，但有時轉眼間又會讓你震驚於他們的成就。只是如果他們能靜下心來，再學點文雅作風那就最好了。”</p><p class=\"MsoList\" style=\"MARGIN:0cm 0cm 6pt 18.7pt;TEXT-INDENT:-18.7pt;mso-add-space:auto;mso-char-indent-count:-1.17\"> </p><p class=\"MsoList\" style=\"MARGIN:0cm 0cm 0cm 11.05pt;TEXT-INDENT:-11.05pt;mso-add-space:auto;mso-char-indent-count:-1.0\"><strong>成年女性名字Female Adult Names：</strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">阿德麗</span>Adrie<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、阿爾泰亞</span>Althaea<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、安娜斯崔娜</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Anastrianna</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、安德拉斯特</span>Andraste<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、安緹諾雅</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Antinua</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、貝絲瑞娜</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Bethrynna</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、比蕾爾</span>Birel<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、施琳</span>Caelynn<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、德魯希麗雅</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Drusilia</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、恩娜</span>Enna<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、菲珞西爾</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Felosial</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、依蓮尼亞</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Ielenia</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、吉蓮尼絲</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Jelenneth</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、凱勒絲</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Keyleth</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、莉雅</span>Lia<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、樂珊娜</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Leshanna</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、梅莉樂</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Meriele</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、米雅莉</span>Mialee<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、奈瓦拉</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Naivara</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、奎蓮娜</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Quelenna</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、希拉瑰</span>Sariel<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、瑰拉瑟</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Quillathe</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、莎奈拉</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Shanairra</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、夏瓦</span>Shava<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、希瑰</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Silaqui</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、提爾拉斯卓</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Theirastra</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、泰雅</span>Thia<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、瓦丹尼亞</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Vadania</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、維蘭瑟</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Valanthe</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">、珊娜菲亞</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Xanaphia</span></p><p class=\"MsoList\" style=\"MARGIN:6pt 0cm 0cm 11.05pt;TEXT-INDENT:-11.05pt;mso-add-space:auto;mso-char-indent-count:-1.0\"><strong>家族姓氏Family Names（通用語譯名）:</strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">阿瑪吉爾</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Amakiir</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（寶石花</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Gemflower</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）、阿瑪斯塔夏</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Amastacia</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（星之花</span>Starflower<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）、嘉蘭諾德</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Galanodel</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（月之呢喃</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Moonwhisper</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）、荷裏米昂</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Holimion</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（鑽石露</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Diamonddew</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）、伊普吉爾</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Ilphelkiir</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（寶石花叢</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Gemblossom</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）、利亞頓</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Liadon</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（銀葉</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Silverfrond</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）、梅利安涅</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Meliamne</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（橡樹末</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Oakenheel</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）、耐羅</span>Nailo<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（夜風</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Nightbreeze</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）、暹諾德</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Siannodel</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（月溪</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Moonbrook</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）、西羅先</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Xiloscient</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">（金瓣</span><span class=\"SpellE\">Goldpetal</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break\" /></span></p><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm\"><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-element:para-border-div\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:medium none;PAGE-BREAK-AFTER:avoid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;MARGIN:2pt 0cm;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-pagination:lines-together;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #B79C61 1.0pt;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm;mso-out1ine-1evel:3\"><strong>精靈特質Elf Traits</strong></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">你的精靈角色擁有的各種天賦能力，都是精靈族千年淬鍊的體現。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span><em><strong>屬性值加成Ability Score Increase</strong></em>。<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">你的敏捷加</span>2<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span><em><strong>年齡Age</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">。儘管精靈的生理成熟速度和人類差不多，但成年的精靈除生理成熟外，還必須擁有成熟的處世經驗。一般而言，精靈一般在</span>100<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">歲前後宣佈成年，壽命可達</span>750<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">歲。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><em><strong>體型Size</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">。精靈中有的身高低於</span>5<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">尺，而有的則甚至超過</span>6<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">尺。他們身材纖細，屬於中型體型。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span><em><strong>速度Speed</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">。你的基礎步行速度爲</span>30<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">尺。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span><em><strong>黑暗視覺Darkvision</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">。精靈早已適應了在幽暗的森林中和夜晚的天空下視物。你在黑暗和微光光照下擁有超常的視力。在微光光照下，你身邊</span>60<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">尺內可以視爲等同於明亮光照。而在黑暗中，該範圍內可視爲等同於微光光照。你無法在黑暗中分辨顏色，只能看到有灰度的黑白畫面。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span><em><strong>敏銳感官Keen Senses</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">。你擁有察覺技能的熟練項。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span><em><strong>精類血統Fey Ancestry</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">。你進行對抗魅惑的豁免時具有優勢，並且不會因魔法效應而陷入睡眠。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span><em><strong>出神Trance</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">。精靈不需要睡眠。他們會在需要休息時陷入持續</span>4<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">個小時的半清醒深度冥想中（通用語中描述此狀態的詞是“出神</span>Trance<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">”）。冥想時精靈也會做夢，這種夢其實是反應多年來現實生活的思維活動。以這種方式休息後，你獲得人類睡眠</span>8<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">小時的全部益處。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span><em><strong>語言language</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria\">。你能夠說、讀、寫通用語和精靈語。精靈語如流體般流暢，有着微妙的語調變化和複雜的語法結構。精靈文學十分豐富多彩，他們的詩歌在其他種族裏也享有很高的評價。許多吟遊詩人都會學習精靈語，並將其韻律運用在他們自己的詩作中。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE:16pt\"><br /></span></p></div><p><strong>海精靈 Sea Elf（舊版）</strong>海精靈是一個與世隔絕且領土意識深厚的族羣，他們與人魚的共同點和與其他精靈的共同點一樣多。 大多數海精靈對克洛維斯聯邦的人民——甚至是其他精靈——持有懷疑態度。</p><p><strong>屬性值加成Ability Score Increase</strong>。你的體質加1。<br /><strong>海精靈訓練Sea Elf Training</strong>。你具有長矛、三叉戟、輕弩和捕網熟練。<br /><strong>海之子Child of the sea</strong>。你具有30尺游泳速度，你可以在空氣和水中呼吸。<br /><strong>海之友Friend of the sea</strong>。使用手勢和聲音，你可以與任何具有天生游泳速度的野獸交流簡單的想法。<br /><strong>語言Languages</strong>。你能說讀、和寫水族語。</p>",
